{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Rope. Bunch Of Idiots. One Huge Mountain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Mountain Together</strong> is a physics-based driving game for 2 to 4 friends who think their friendships can survive being literally tied together. You\u2019re tethered by a rope, driving wobbly cars on roads that are way too thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/ea3940e637080eb05724c1cc7334be01.poster.avif?t=1774705657\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/ea3940e637080eb05724c1cc7334be01.webm?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/ea3940e637080eb05724c1cc7334be01.mp4?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goal? Reach the Top. The Reality? Gravity.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tethered Chaos:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move as one. If your friend drives off a cliff, congrats you\u2019re probably going with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The &quot;Save Me&quot; Winch:</strong> One of you fell? No worries. Use the winch to haul your screaming friends back up before the whole squad plummet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/6aefd64e1ff9b3a9a3c47c039dc10f1b.poster.avif?t=1774705657\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/6aefd64e1ff9b3a9a3c47c039dc10f1b.webm?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/6aefd64e1ff9b3a9a3c47c039dc10f1b.mp4?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wobbly Physics:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cars don't drive; they bounce, tilt, and slide. It\u2019s &quot;controlled&quot; driving... mostly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/fcf783e033c02cc059d81b589801e0bf.poster.avif?t=1774705657\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/fcf783e033c02cc059d81b589801e0bf.webm?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/fcf783e033c02cc059d81b589801e0bf.mp4?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Biomes of Pure Misery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From &quot;Hey, this is nice&quot; to &quot;Why are we doing this?&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grasslands:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;easy&quot; part. (It\u2019s not actually easy).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/315164592ebd3f4866d44bb5ad6d2d38.poster.avif?t=1774705657\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/315164592ebd3f4866d44bb5ad6d2d38.webm?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/315164592ebd3f4866d44bb5ad6d2d38.mp4?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Peaks:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding is mandatory. Traction is a myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/23c9449aec170de7c63201edef998c13.poster.avif?t=1774705657\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/23c9449aec170de7c63201edef998c13.webm?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/23c9449aec170de7c63201edef998c13.mp4?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Swamp:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, exploding Tikis and murky water designed to ruin your momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/90fb4b738f845b83bf007e5b4b3e9218.poster.avif?t=1774705657\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/90fb4b738f845b83bf007e5b4b3e9218.webm?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955660/extras/90fb4b738f845b83bf007e5b4b3e9218.mp4?t=1774705657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Look Good While Falling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ride with funny cosmetics. If you\u2019re going to explode for the 50th time today, you might as well look cool doing it.</